type":"paragraph","text":"長野県のみなさんに乃木坂46を\n少しでも知ってもらえたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざわざ長野に来てくださった\nまりっ会のみなさん、\nバッチリ見えました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/21/1720615/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/21/1720615/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\n昨日ホテルは美雲とペアでした。\nめずらしいでしょ??\nいっぱい語ったー\nなんか嬉しかったな。\n英語教えてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/21/1720615/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美雲先生！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よっしゃテストがんばろー...うう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-23671":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついーんてーるのばっかーりぼーんー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんでーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/04/30/0437640/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラフレクランさん風ご挨拶。\n前回のらじらー！で\n募集したやつ（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はゆっくりできたので\n録画してたアニメみたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「俺ガイル。」\n「俺物語‼︎」\n「終わりのセラフ」\n「境界のRINNE」\n「食戟のソーマ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今季はこんな感じ\n他にも何個かみてます～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメ好きなひと\n今度の握手会とかで\nアニメトークしよーー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/04/30/0437640/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、今週土日は\nパシフィコ横浜で握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土曜は全握、日曜は個握と\nGWも乃木充......♪\n遊びにきてくれるみなさんよろしくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてます(´,,•ω•,,｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土曜日の全握は\n第18レーン 生駒×優里×中元"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人レーンきたーー！\nテーマパークみたいなレーンだね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ふぁむのみなさん\nふぁみたんのみなさん\nひめとも仲良くしてください( ˇωˇ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゅんきゅん王国のみんな\nもちろん待ってるからねーー！！\n寄り道しちゃだめだぞー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この3人といえば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメトークしよーー♡(2回目)\nこの3人ともアニメ好きなんだけど\n好きなジャンルが違うんだよねぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんとゆったんは\n今季なに見てるんだろ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、それだけじゃなくて\nいろんなお話しようね！\nびーむもやっちゃうよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握は半月ぶり？\nお寝坊は許さないんだからねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服はもう買ってあるんだけど\nひめがひとりで選んだんだー\nメンバーも褒めてくれたんだ(＊'ω`＊)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみーー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/04/30/0437640/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n日曜の夜は、らじらー！サンデー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな握手会のあとは早く帰るか\n帰り道にスマホか\n忙しくても聞いてね♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会お留守番ちーむは\n何が何でも聞いてね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは声優アーツに井口裕香さん\n10時台には乃木坂より秋元真夏ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎番組へのお便り\n◎リクエストソング\n◎かわいく言いやがれっ！！\n◎無機物48\n◎らじらー式恋愛参考書"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Twitterでつぶやく時のハッシュタグは\n#nhkらじらー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待ちしてます( ˇωˇ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/04/30/0437640/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、30日発売のブブカで\n真夏さんと必殺技対決してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに決着ついちゃうかな？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェックしてくれなきゃ\nひめたんびーむ（<・ω・>）\nなーんちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/04/30/0437640/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/04/30/0437640/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スキンケアなにしてる？\n保湿とか基本的なことを大事にしてるよ\n化粧水変えたらメイクさんに\n最近お肌いいね～て褒められたのが\n嬉しかったな(´｡･v･｡｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/04/30/0437640/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、もうすぐでGWだね！\n最近行きたいと思ってるトコとか\nあるのかな？\n乃木坂に入ってなかったら\n日焼けとか気にしないでいいから\n海とか行きたかったね～\n時間あったら広島帰りたいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/04/30/0437640/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか隠れている触角が\n復活する事はあるんでしょうか？\n制服以外の時は\n触角にこだわりはないのよ！\n握手会の時は気分で\nツインの触角あったりなかったり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/04/30/0437640/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいえば、俺も俺がいる見てる！\nひめたん一期も見てた？\nみてたよーー！もちろん！\n私は結衣ちゃん（＾ω＾）やっはろー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/04/30/0437640/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの日記の\nコメント欄下２ケタに46を踏んだ方へ 手書きでコメ返するコーナー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ ひめたん46 ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/04/30/0437640/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きらきらにしてみた、気分で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゅわっち！しゅわっち！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1泊2日、東京から離れたところで\n収録してきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どえらい筋肉痛なの⊂( ˆoˆ )⊃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった！空気がきれいだった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メール送れなくて\n心配かけちゃってごめんね( ´•̥ω•̥` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"許してくれる？( ´•̥ω•̥` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}}